<p>You revert your body to a previous state, healing yourself for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100,<br>paradox 300">275, 370, 443, 506, 561</acronym> life and removing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>paradox 300">1, 2, 3, 4, 5</acronym> physical status effects (both good and bad).</p><p>The amount of life healed will scale with your Spellpower.</p>